create('README.md', '''# greenfield-proof

Reusable TypeScript greeting API with a companion CLI for developers. Private, UNLICENSED fixture; not published.

## Structure

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `package.json` | Package manifest: ESM, `exports` to `./dist/index.js`, `bin` to `./dist/cli.js`, `files` limited to `dist` |
| `src/index.ts` | Reusable API: `greet(name?)` |
| `src/cli.ts` | Thin executable adapter over `greet` with a stable `--help` |
| `tsup.config.ts` | Build: both entries, ESM, declaration files |
| `tsconfig.json` | Strict TypeScript for `src` and `test` with Node types |
| `test/` | `node:test` behaviour tests for the API and the CLI |
| `dist/` | Built output from `npm run build` (ignored by git) |
| `docs/` | PRD, ADRs, code style, architecture index, UX canon |
| `roadmap/` | zeroh-roadmap root: config, schema seam, backlog, phases, arcs |
| `reviews/` | Emitted changelog and release reviews |
| `scripts/` | README catalog checker and roadmap helper scripts |
